We additionally provide an archival repository with the following:

(1) the E3SM code (msp2 development branch) used for the runs;
(2) instructions/scripts to reproduce the runs;
(3) the LHS parameter samples driving the perturbed-parameter ensemble.

The following subfolders correspond to the items above, in order:

01_e3sm-msp2_code
02_runs
03_samples
